# A Concept Space Approach to Addressing the Vocabulary Problem in Scientific Information Retrieval: An Experiment on the Worm Community System.

**Authors:** Chen, Hsinchun, Ng, Tobun D., Martinez, Joanne, Schatz, Bruce R.

## Abstract
Presents an algorithmic approach to addressing the vocabulary problem in scientific information retrieval and information sharing, using the molecular biology domain as an example. A cognitive study and a follow-up document retrieval study were conducted using first a conjoined fly-worm thesaurus and then an actual worm database and the conjoined thesaurus. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ564197

